Web text (C4, Wikipedia) consistently yields $\Kempirical{=}2$, while preliminary evidence suggests structured academic text (arXiv) permits $\Kempirical{=}3$ (Section~\ref{sec:cross_domain}; single model, $N{=}2{,}200$).
